    "updated_at": "2026-03-18T14:39:48Z",
    "body": "Some options of how to solve this:\n- Change the behavior of those registries (as per https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/12274)\n- Add some state to elments when parsing about whether they are \"really\" going to be constructed or just provisionally, and only queue the CE reactions after sanitization\n- Specifically don't schedule those CE reactions for custom elements not allowed by the registry, or block lookup of those elements in the registry.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
