    "body": "Given that we do have `customelementregistry` attribute related WPTs already, we may want to figure out how the attribute interact with this case earlier than later.\nMy thought is that we may need to modify `customElementRegistry.initialize` so we're able to reason how we can skip initializing elements with attribute while running initialization steps. Overall, we'll need to preserve the attribute's ability to create null registry element in function like `innerHTML`.",
